&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Senior Content Manager - FTC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;London, United Kingdom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Content Manager, you&#39;ll own client&#39;s content strategy across multiple platforms - including Brandbank, Amazon Vendor Central, and PIM — and lead the workflows that bring it to life. You&#39;ll act as the connective tissue between brand, marketing, and creative teams, bringing strategic rigour and hands-on execution in equal measure. From NPD launches to ongoing content maintenance, you&#39;ll set the standard for quality and consistency across every channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement content strategy that serves client&#39;s commercial objectives, including A/B testing plans for Amazon product pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end content management across all publishing platforms: case raising, set-up, upload, editing, amends, and ongoing maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as NPD project lead for content creation, development, and publishing on DCOMM, ensuring best-in-class product launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage content execution projects from scoping and asset review through to proposal creation and creative team alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all published content is accurate, on-brand, and error-free across every channel and platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, brand, and marketing teams to align content with strategic requirements and brand guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the copywriter and designers to produce content that is visually rich and copy-strong, within best-in-class guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and commercial insight to inform content decisions and drive continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor team workflows and content management processes, ensuring adherence to agreed standards and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build proactive working relationships across the wider business, keeping key stakeholders informed and aligned&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in content management, spanning strategy development, platform publishing, and end-to-end project delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on proficiency with Brandbank, Amazon Vendor Central, and PIM platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing content projects — scoping, briefing, asset review, proposal creation, and creative team alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of SEO principles and their application to product content and digital channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong editing and proofreading skills, with a high standard of accuracy and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading, mentoring, and inspiring small creative teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative working style, with the ability to build effective relationships across brand, product, and marketing functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-informed approach to decision-making, with an understanding of how commercial priorities shape content strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously and maintain quality under shifting timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Excel and Microsoft Planner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within the alcohol, beverage, or FMCG sector (desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced use of Gen AI tools to enhance content output, workflow efficiency, and publishing quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing AI-assisted workflows for yourself and your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to guide others on effective, responsible AI tool usage within a content context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic approach to complex, multi-step content challenges — from brief through to live publication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI capabilities and limitations, with rigorous human oversight applied to all published content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
